  "content_id": "16136233",
  "title": "Stellar XLM Network Fees",
  "description": "Stellar (XLM) Network – Ultra-Low and Instant\nStellar is optimized for fast, cheap payments across borders, with one of the lowest fee str...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ2QV8W7CC0PXMZPV2VE1GJ\">Stellar (XLM) Network – Ultra-Low and Instant</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Stellar is optimized for fast, cheap payments across borders, with one of the lowest fee structures in the crypto space.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ2QV8W8CBNMAWJKC7ERS3Y\">How XLM Fees Work</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Fees are:</p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Flat and minimal</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Based on a tiny fixed base fee</b> (currently 0.00001 XLM)<br>Paid in <b>XLM</b>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge handles fee estimation automatically—you barely notice the cost.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ2QV8WFTX1KGYX9W3P1NF2\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>One setting</b> – Stellar’s network design makes multiple presets unnecessary. Fast and cheap by default.</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ2QV8W1KZN583PY2C24FZA\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Usually <b>$0.000001 to $0.000005 USD</b> per transaction—effectively free.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ2QV8WAPYZ3VZB37W1P3JP\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Stellar’s near-free fees are perfect for payments, remittances, and microtransactions. Edge lets you send XLM instantly without worrying about gas prices or surges.</p><hr>",
